tion":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:a7537f4c939f9cdb07c2441e227b75f4e0946a0a5aa7851c7fe9edcd6da4708d","file":"preprints/Threshold-parallel-repetition-for-finite-dimensional-entangled-games-September-25-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex","line":50,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"1af1d1db19982bbc2d5c8c22f91576b4940192d0fa0a7afc4d90fcaef62338b8","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Threshold-parallel-repetition-for-finite-dimensional-entangled-games-September-25-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:a7537f4c939f9cdb07c2441e227b75f4e0946a0a5aa7851c7fe9edcd6da4708d","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Threshold-parallel-repetition-for-finite-dimensional-entangled-games-September-25-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex#L50"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nThere is a universal constant $\\kappa_0>0$ such that the following holds.\nLet $G$ be any finite two-player one-round game with Boolean acceptance\npredicate and entangled value $v=\\omega^*(G)<1$. For every\n$0<\\delta<1-v$, every integer $k\\ge1$, and every finite-dimensional\njoint strategy for $k$ repetitions,\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:main}\n \\Pr\\!\\left[W_k\\ge\\lceil(v+\\delta)k\\rceil\\right]\n \\le \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\kappa_0\\delta^5}\n                         {1+\\log d}\\,k\\right).\n\\end{equation}\nThe same inequality holds for the supremum over those strategies."}
